            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Inventory for 1 MJ heat from natural gas, burned in a cogeneration unit with a capacity of 15 kWth. The multioutput process "natural gas, burned in cogen 15kWth delivers the coproducts "heat, at cogen 15kWth, natural gas, allocation exergy" and "electricity, at cogen 15kWth, natural gas, allocation exergy". The energy efficiency is 26% for electricity and 67% for heat. The exergy factor is 1 for ectricity and 0.139 for heat. This leads to the allocation factor of 0.74 for electricity an 0.26 for heat.;
